# Purely ADDITIVE: one new key per table, no existing entry modified or reordered.
# AR1 = the anchor rerun. c2 surface (6,240 wing faces) x 64 wall-normal cells
# = 399,360 cells, r = 1.1674. It is NOT a member of the A3GC triple and does
# not appear in any triple arithmetic; it is a single graded level.

--- a/cases/dafoam/ladder-a/A3/curriculum_A3GC/a3gc_run.sh
